OL,3,GNEWSASNP cancels #60,000 loan repayment
OL,4,Aowed to Peter Murrell                  
OL,6,FThe SNP have written off #60,000 in    
OL,7,Foutstanding loan payments owed to the  
OL,8,Fparty's former chief executive, Peter  
OL,9,FMurrell, following his conviction for  
OL,10,Fembezzlement.                          
OL,12,FIn a statement, the party said it did  
OL,13,Fnot consider itself to have a liability
OL,14,Ftowards Murrell after he was jailed    
OL,15,Fearlier this year for illicitly using  
OL,16,Fparty funds to buy luxury goods,       
OL,17,Fvehicles and jewellery.                
OL,19,FThe decision was made following a      
OL,20,Fmeeting of the SNP's national executive
OL,21,Fcommittee on Saturday.                 
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
