OL,3,GNEWSASNP cancels #60,000 loan repayment
OL,4,Aowed to Peter Murrell                  
OL,6,FThe party said it was still "taking    
OL,7,Fsteps" to recover the funds embezzled  
OL,8,Fby Murrell through the courts. A       
OL,9,Fproceeds of crime hearing is due to    
OL,10,Ftake place in December.                
